    - target: {fileID: 8563684494448067901, guid: 0a3b6392f04558844bd340e68ced1ff9,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: '

        This is a confound-minimised Singleton Detection task, in
        which participants are instructed to locate and touch the uniquely shaped
        item from a set of fruits.


        The experiment is conducted across two
        distinct environments, a sparsely detailed room and highly detailed greenhouse.



        Experiment
        Settings: Assets/StreamingAssets/Singleton-Detection-Settings.json


        Save
        to: E.g. D:Data/VR-Singleton-Detection


        Participant ID: Pxx

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
